     "body": "<p>A few notes:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>When this ticket was created, Archival Groups could have tombstones of resources purged. This will no longer be allowed and Fedora will return a 405.\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>This is documented in the Delete vs Purge page: <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Delete+vs+Purge\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Delete+vs+Purge</a></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>I added an additional note about this to the <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Glossary#Glossary-ArchivalGroupag\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Glossary#Glossary-ArchivalGroupag</a>  as well</li>\n\t<li>There may be other issues to document around archival groups but this ticket was in relation to issue brought about and resolved by <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3881\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3881</a>, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3882\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3882</a>, and <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3883\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3883</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
